s used per the \\ufffd#6\\ufffdGoogle Privacy Policy[\\ufffd/#5\\ufffd|\\ufffd/#6\\ufffd], including for product improvement. \");var e=_.Ex(\" Data from Google Workspace is used and human reviewed per the \\ufffd#5\\ufffdGemini Apps Privacy Notice[\\ufffd/#5\\ufffd|\\ufffd/#6\\ufffd]. Data Gemini shares with other Google services is used per the \\ufffd#6\\ufffdGoogle Privacy Policy[\\ufffd/#5\\ufffd|\\ufffd/#6\\ufffd], including for product improvement. \");\nvar f=_.Ex(\" Data from YouTube is used and human reviewed per the \\ufffd#5\\ufffdGemini Apps Privacy Notice[\\ufffd/#5\\ufffd|\\ufffd/#6\\ufffd]. Data Gemini shares with other Google services is used per the \\ufffd#6\\ufffdGoogle Privacy Policy[\\ufffd/#5\\ufffd|\\ufffd/#6\\ufffd], including for product improvement. \");var g=_.Ex(\" Data from Search services is used and human reviewed per the \\ufffd#5\\ufffdGemini Apps Privacy Notice[\\ufffd/#5\\ufffd|\\ufffd/#6\\ufffd]. Data Gemini shares with other Google services is used per the \\ufffd#6\\ufffdGoogle Privacy Policy[\\ufffd/#5\\ufffd|\\ufffd/#6\\ufffd], including for product improvement. \");\nvar l=_.Ex(\" Data from Contacts is used and human reviewed per the \\ufffd#5\\ufffdGemini Apps Privacy Notice[\\ufffd/#5\\ufffd|\\ufffd/#6\\ufffd]. Data Gemini shares with other Google services is used per the \\ufffd#6\\ufffdGoogle Privacy Policy[\\ufffd/#5\\ufffd|\\ufffd/#6\\ufffd], including for product improvement. \");return[[\"consentCheckboxesTpl\",\"\"],\" Disconnect \\ufffd0\\ufffd from Gemini? \",\" Connect \\ufffd0\\ufffd to Gemini? \",\" Connect Google Workspace? \",\" Gemini will use this calendar \",\" Connect \\ufffd0\\ufffd? \",\n\"Disconnecting apps and deleting data\",a,\"What\\u2019s not changing\",b,\"\\ufffd*20:1\\ufffd Your choices here don't change your research and development settings in Google Health, and whether other services exchange data. Other services continue personalizing and sharing data according to their own settings. \\ufffd/*20:1\\ufffd\\ufffd*22:2\\ufffd Your choices here don't change Gemini's ability to use public data to respond to you. For example, if Search services and YouTube aren't connected, Gemini can still use public websites and videos in Google Search and YouTube to respond to you. \\ufffd/*22:2\\ufffd\",\n' Your choices here also don\\'t change whether contacts are saved or used by Google services, including Gemini, based on other settings. For example, if the \\ufffd#2\\ufffd\"Save contact info from your devices\"\\ufffd/#2\\ufffd setting is on, information about your contacts from your signed-in devices will be used by Gemini to make these contacts easier to interact with across Google services. ',c,\"Your data from \\ufffd0\\ufffd and your Google Account is used to:\",\"Things to know\",\"You\\u2019re in control\",\n\" You can change these choices in your Gemini settings and \\ufffd#27\\ufffd manage and delete your Gemini Apps activity\\ufffd/#27\\ufffd anytime. \",\"\\ufffd#30\\ufffd Learn more about personalization with Connected Apps \\ufffd/#30\\ufffd\",' \"Contacts\" includes Google Contacts and contact info from your signed-in devices. ',\" Data shared between Gemini and Google Photos includes things like photos, videos, info about your device, Gemini chats, and \\ufffd#2\\ufffdlocation info\\ufffd/#2\\ufffd (from your IP address, device, and content), as well as insights drawn from them. Data shared may relate to topics you find sensitive. \",\nd,\" Your choices here don't change other personalization settings, whether other services exchange data, whether Google Photos uses data to improve its own services, and Gemini\\u2019s use of public data. \",\" Data shared between Gemini and Google Workspace includes things like emails, files, events, info about your device, Gemini chats, and \\ufffd#2\\ufffdlocation info\\ufffd/#2\\ufffd (from your IP address, device, and content), as well as insights drawn from them. Data shared may relate to topics you find sensitive. \",\ne,\" Your choices here don't change other personalization settings, whether other services exchange data, whether Google Workspace uses data to improve its own services, and Gemini\\u2019s use of public data. \",\" Data shared between Gemini and YouTube includes things like your YouTube data, info about your device, Gemini chats, and \\ufffd#2\\ufffdlocation info\\ufffd/#2\\ufffd (from your IP address, device, and content), as well as insights drawn from them. Data shared may relate to topics you find sensitive. \",\nf,\" Your choices here don't change other personalization settings, whether other services exchange data, whether YouTube uses data to improve its own services, and Gemini's use of public data. \",\" Data sent from Gemini to Search services includes things like info about your Gemini chats and device, as well as \\ufffd#2\\ufffdlocation info\\ufffd/#2\\ufffd from your IP address and device. Data sent from Search services to Gemini includes things like your saved data from Search services and insights drawn from it. Data shared may relate to topics you find sensitive. \",\ng,\" Your choices here don't change other personalization settings, whether other services exchange data, whether Search services use data to improve their own services, and Gemini's use of public data, like public websites available through Google Search. \",\" Data shared between Gemini and Contacts includes things like info about your contacts (such as phone numbers, addresses, and birthdays), info about your device, Gemini chats, and \\ufffd#2\\ufffdlocation info\\ufffd/#2\\ufffd (from your IP address, device, and content), as well as insights drawn from them. Data shared may relate to topics you find sensitive. \",\nl,\" Your choices here don't change other settings, whether other services exchange data, whether Contacts uses data to improve its own services, and Gemini's use of public data. \",\"To complete your requests, Gemini will:\",\" Learn more \",\" Share information from this chat, including your prompts, Gemini's responses, and the general area of your location if relevant. \",\" When Gemini uses other apps, your Google Ads data may be shared if it's included in your conversation. \",\" When Gemini uses other apps, your Google Analytics data may be shared if it's included in your conversation. \",\n\" When Gemini responds using other connected apps, your \\ufffd0\\ufffd content may be shared if it\\u2019s included in your conversation \",\" Using Google Home controls \",\" How Google respects your privacy \",\"How Google respects your privacy: \",\" Your Google Workspace content is not used to improve Gemini. You can turn off Google Workspace from the Apps page. \",\" Your Google Photos content is not used to improve Gemini. You can turn off Google Photos from the Apps page. \",\" Your Google Home sensor data (such as video footage, audio recordings and sensor readings) is not used to improve Gemini. You can turn off Google Home from the Apps page. \",\n\" You can disconnect Google Ads from the Connected Apps page. \",\" Your Google Analytics data will only be used to improve your experience or subject to your Google Analytics data sharing settings. \\ufffd#2\\ufffd\\ufffd/#2\\ufffd You can disconnect Google Analytics from the Connected Apps page. \",\" You can turn off \\ufffd0\\ufffd from the Apps page. \",\" Learn how your content is used \",\" Learn how your content is used. \",\" Turn on both Workspace smart feature settings \",\" Open Gmail settings, select See all settings, go to Manage Workspace smart feature settings. Check both of the boxes next to smart feature setting \",\n\" Read more \",\" Ask again \",\" Gemini will access and manage events only for the primary calendar in this Google Account. \",[1,\"banner-container\"],[1,\"banner-items\"],[\"align\",\"center\",1,\"consent-dialog-header\"],[1,\"user-profile-info-container\"],[1,\"dialog-content\"],[\"alt\",\"Gemini\",1,\"banner-logo\",3,\"src\"],[1,\"vertic