 Catch-22 for kids\",promptText:\"Write a summary of the book Catch-22 for kids\"},\n{displayText:\"Write a shopping list for taco tuesday\",promptText:\"Write a shopping list for taco tuesday\"},{displayText:\"Write a short story about the first day of spring\",promptText:\"Write a short story about the first day of spring\"}],[21]:[{displayText:\"Build a fireworks generator\",promptText:\"Build a fireworks generator\"},{displayText:\"Build a weekly workout routine\",promptText:\"Build a weekly workout routine\"},{displayText:\"Build an asteroid shooter game\",promptText:\"Build an asteroid shooter game\"},\n{displayText:\"Make a website for my photography portfolio\",promptText:\"Make a website for my photography portfolio\"},{displayText:\"Build a meal prep app based on what's in my kitchen\",promptText:\"Build a meal prep app based on what's in my kitchen\"}],[22]:[{displayText:\"Research and plan a trip to Japan for foodies\",promptText:\"Research and plan a trip to Japan for foodies\"},{displayText:\"Research health benefits of cold plunges\",promptText:\"Research health benefits of cold plunges\"},{displayText:\"Research most affordable family cell phone plans\",\npromptText:\"Research most affordable family cell phone plans\"},{displayText:\"Research best daycare centers in Mexico City\",promptText:\"Research best daycare centers in Mexico City\"},{displayText:\"Research key ideas in Kant's Critique of Pure Reason\",promptText:\"Research key ideas in Kant's Critique of Pure Reason\"}],[23]:[{displayText:\"Create an image of my own custom mini figure\",promptText:\"First ask me to upload an image and then create a 1/7 scale commercialized figurine of the characters in the picture, in a realistic style, in a real environment. The figurine is placed on a computer desk. The figurine has a round transparent acrylic base, with no text on the base. The content on the computer screen is a 3D modeling process of this figurine. Next to the computer screen is a toy packaging box, designed in a style reminiscent of high-quality collectible figures, printed with original artwork. The packaging features two-dimensional flat illustrations.\"},\n{displayText:\"Create an image of me as a superhero\",promptText:\"First ask me to upload a selfie. Generate an image based on my selfie of a highly realistic superhero photo. The photo is taken outdoors and I'm flying high above a city. Capture the scene with a natural photographic look, realistic lighting, skin texture, and detail. The framing, angle, and perspective should be as realistic as possible, as if it were an actual photo.\"},{displayText:\"Create an image of me with an 80s-style makeover\",\npromptText:\"First ask me to upload a selfie. Then generate an image using my selfie of me with an 80s style makeover.\"},{displayText:\"Create an image of my professional headshot\",promptText:\"First ask me for a selfie. Transform my selfie into a fresh but professional image suitable for a social media profile. The lighting should be natural, flattering, and multidimensional. My head is slightly tilted so it doesn't look stiff and it should look like I'm in a modern, bright office with a blurred background.\"}],\n[24]:[{displayText:\"Create a video of a highway timelapse at night\",promptText:\"Create a video of a highway timelapse at night\"},{displayText:\"Create a video ad for a new artisan bakery\",promptText:\"Create a video ad for a new artisan bakery\"},{displayText:\"Create a video of friends sailing across the ocean\",promptText:\"Create a video of friends sailing across the ocean\"},{displayText:\"Create a video of a cat skateboarding\",promptText:\"Create a video of a cat skateboarding\"},{displayText:\"Create a video of a hummingbird in slow motion\",\npromptText:\"Create a video of a hummingbird in slow motion\"}],[28]:[{displayText:\"Triage my emails\",promptText:\"Triage my emails\"},{displayText:\"Organize my inbox every morning\",promptText:\"Every morning at 7am, take a look at the unread emails in my inbox from the past 24h and summarize what I need to know, create tasks for things I need to follow up on, reply when appropriate, and mark the emails as read.\"},{displayText:\"Draft a reply to an email that needs my attention\",promptText:\"Find a recent email in my inbox that needs my attention. Search my Drive for any relevant documents to inform the response. Draft a reply.\"},\n{displayText:\"Organize my schedule next week\",promptText:\"Looking at next week, block 30 minutes every day for lunch when I\\u2019m available (between 11:30 and 2pm) and accept all my one-on-ones\"}],[29]:[{displayText:\"Brief me on my next customer call\",promptText:\"Brief me ahead of that customer call tomorrow. Gather all important info from my drive and the web.\"},{displayText:\"Brief me on the day ahead each morning\",promptText:\"Every weekday at 8AM, send me a briefing to help me prepare for my day ahead.\"},\n{displayText:\"Brief me on things to do over the weekend\",promptText:\"Every Friday at 3PM, send me a brief on fun things to do around me this weekend.\"},{displayText:\"Brief me on local news every week\",promptText:\"Every Monday at 6AM, give me a brief on local news.\"}],[35]:[{displayText:\"Book a car rental\",promptText:\"Book a mid size SUV rental for my upcoming trip, keep it under $80/day. Get the trip details from my email\"},{displayText:\"Book a local service\",promptText:\"Research top-rated service providers, compare pricing and availability, then book the best option for this week under my budget\"},\n{displayText:\"Book activities and experiences\",promptText:\"Find family-friendly activities near me this weekend, compare cost and availability, and get tickets ready to book after I review.\"},{displayText:\"Live research job listings\",promptText:\"Go to a top professional networking site, check open roles after I log in, and capture company name, size, funding stage, hiring contact, and deadline\"}],[30]:[{displayText:\"Walk me through how to solve a tricky math problem\",promptText:\"Walk me through how to solve a tricky math problem\"},\n{displayText:\"Brainstorm ideas for a short story I'm trying to write\",promptText:\"Brainstorm ideas for a short story I'm trying to write\"},{displayText:\"Practice questions for my history test on the American Revolution\",promptText:\"Practice questions for my history test on the American Revolution\"},{displayText:\"Review my writing for the opening page of a short story I'm working on\",promptText:\"Review my writing for the opening page of a short story I'm working on\"},{displayText:\"Explain this like it's a sports game: the US electoral process\",\npromptText:\"Explain this like it's a sports game: the US electoral process\"}]},xhk,yhk,zhk,Ahk,Bhk,Chk,Dhk,Ehk,Fhk,Ghk={[2]:[...((xhk=J7[20])!=null?xhk:[]).slice(0,2),...((yhk=J7[21])!=null?yhk:[]).slice(0,3)],[1]:[...((zhk=J7[22])!=null?zhk:[])],[14]:[...((Ahk=J7[23])!=null?Ahk:[])],[11]:[...((Bhk=J7[24])!=null?Bhk:[])],[22]:[...((Chk=J7[28])!=null?Chk:[]),...((Dhk=J7[29])!=null?Dhk:[]),...((Ehk=J7[35])!=null?Ehk:[])],[24]:[...((Fhk=J7[30])!=null?Fhk:[])]},Hhk=[{displayText:\"Write\",hdb:51},{displayText:\"Build\",\nhdb:51},{displayText:\"Research\",hdb:50},{displayText:\"Create an image\",hdb:82},{displayText:\"Create a video\",hdb:71}];var Ihk=class extends _.k{constructor(a){super(a)}Ly(a){return _.Bi(this,2,a)}cab(a){return _.zi(this,4,a)}};var Jhk=class extends _.k{constructor(a){super(a)}};var Khk=new _.Kq(\"45739943\",!1),Lhk=new _.Nq(\"45739942\",_.Ch(Jhk)(\"[]\"),Jhk);var Mhk=new _.Kq(\"45761574\",!0);var Nhk=()=>[(0,_.nd)(\"BSFuyb\").then(()=>_.naj)],ghk=(a,b)=>b.label,Ohk=class{transform(a,b,c,d){var e=new _.pB,f=new rhk;a=_.Ai(f,1,shk,a).setPosition(b);c=_.ui(a,3,c);d=_.Bi(c,4,d);d=_.Bf(d);e=_.wh(e,rhk,32,d);return _.oB(_.Bf(e))}};Ohk.Ba=function(a){return new (a||Ohk)};Ohk.Pf=_.Nv({name:\"buildVeMetadataForAutosuggestion\",type:Ohk,Gf:!0});\nvar bhk=function(a){a.Jk?(a.ha.oa.nex